### 2.1 BB-ST-2（SideStory「巴别塔」，前文明）

```
Priestess: I prepared a gift for you, {nickname}.
           Do you remember? This is the polarization formed when AMa-10 was born.
           You said you found a rhythm within its waveform. Of course, I added a little personal touch.

Priestess: The stars are losing their color. This world no longer has norms, doesn't it?
           This place will fall silent soon, almost like we've never been here.

Priestess: Come walk with me, before the silence comes.
           I hope... we'll get to see this world's future with our own eyes together, {nickname}.
```

### 2.2 14-19（第十四章「慈悲灯塔」，内化宇宙）

**自报家门（转述初次见面）**：
```
Priestess: "My name is Priestess, a linguist. I am researching the final sound waves emitted by planets as they die.
           I like quietly spending my time alone, but I also wanted to find someone to explore the universe with."
           And now... It's your turn.
```

**重逢 / 呼唤**：
```
Priestess: ... Hold my hand tight, Doctor.
           Next time, please don't leave me without saying a word.
           You wouldn't accept something like this happening again either, right?
           Mmm... What's wrong, Dr. {nickname}?
           Why are you looking at me so strangely?

Priestess: *sigh* Where did you manage to learn such a strange language this time around?
           Did you sneakily upload your cognition to some civilization out on the tip of the spiral arm in this round of hibernation?
           Alright, I'd just like to reconfirm whether or not your capability for language has been properly restored.
           Don't tell me that you've even forgotten my name just because you've had a big nap.
           Come on, say my name again. The database will analyze all of your voice data.

Priestess: Doctor!
           Your mind's wandered off again. It seems you have a penchant for speaking in that alien language.
```

**关系定义（名句）**：
```
Doctor:    Were we... intimate?
Priestess: Intimate? I wouldn't use that term to describe our relationship.
           It belittles all that we have experienced together in the past.

Priestess: It's fine, I'm not upset.
           Though your mind may not remember, I am sure that in the deepest recesses of your consciousness,
           deeper than any probe or instrument can reach, there are still traces of me.
           If it were not the case, then why would you allow me to keep holding your hand like this?

Priestess: "Holding hands"... Yes, we had many different ways to 'hold hands'.
           Much of the time, we had no need to use any specific part of the body to do it.
```

**源石与「真正的天才是你」**：
```
Priestess: A crystal formed from our contentions and collisions, condensing the innumerable truths
           left behind by the pioneers who watched the cosmos.
           It is truly a beauty.

Priestess: Everyone said that I was the one who created Originium and the future both,
           as though I were akin to a god.
           But I always knew that the true genius was you, {nickname}.
```

**关于终末（"宇宙墓碑"）**：
```
Priestess: We will wait until this world and the starry sky above welcome their final moments...
           Our universe will become an immense tomb of its own.
           There is no hope in any corner of any star in the heavens.
           Every attempt at resistance only ended in its premature destruction.
           The conclusion was rather simple. Any life formed from ordinary matter is unable to escape.

Priestess: Here... It's "The unknowable".
           We made a wish together when we created this place.
           When the last warmth of the stars dissipates, and the weave of time falls apart into chaos,
           we will let the darkness wrap around the two of us like a blanket.

Priestess: We will wait until this world and the starry sky above welcome their final moments...
```

**分别（字幕）**：
```
Priestess: But there is one thing that I am sure of, {nickname}.
           That when you are truly confused by everything, you will remember:
           the answers you seek were here all along.
           I will be here.

[字幕] Go, "Doctor". Go solve your conundrums.
       All that you wish for, I am able to grant.
       And once all the grand rhythms and minute pulsations have fallen into silence...
       You will return to my side.
```

### 2.3 15-16（第十五章「离解复合」，苏醒重逢）

```
Priestess: Long time no see.

Priestess: Dr. {nickname}... I see you've met.
           Then let me introduce myself.
           Priestess. Linguist, and colleague to Dr. {nickname}.
```

> ✅ 注意「**Dr.** {nickname}」这一形式 —— 她冠以「博士/Dr.」头衔。

```
Priestess: You've implemented a backdoor in my project and restricted my access.
           The data tells me I'm losing this piece of Originium. My attempts at maintenance have been in vain.
           Impressive. Your rash actions have borne fruit.

Priestess: You are anxious to defy a reality that you cannot perceive, Theresis.
           You were much calmer when you plotted with {nickname}.

Priestess: Watching? No.
           I have long lost the energy and passion to observe the evolution of a newborn civilization.
           All I did was look up the data newly added to Originium, and checked some information that interested me.
           The expansion of Originium is a consensus between me and {nickname}.

Priestess: In the language of Originium, reality and falsehood are not polar opposites.
           When I first created this language, I wanted it to decipher the ultimate question
           that we had been unable to answer, despite all our efforts.
           It. {nickname}.

Priestess: Two Terrans, a frail and overlooked race.
           I'm starting to understand why you're so interested in them... {nickname}.
```

### 2.4 15-17（第十五章，前文明闪回 + 与凯尔希对峙）

```
Priestess: This reunion is not what I expected, but I'm willing to accept an unorthodox experience.
           We've dreamed together too many times to count, how we would meet again when we awoke from our deep sleep.
           We could wander freely on this planet completely covered by Originium, in a world that belonged only to us.
           A world only one step away from our shared, ultimate vision, and we'd walk towards our new hope...
           It ought to be a bright, sunny day too.

Priestess: I know you lost part of your memories in a series of unfortunate accidents.
           It's a pity, but I believe your partial memory loss will not change your nature,
           and the connection between us remains unshakable.
           I've no wish to be harsh on you, but I hope you can understand—time is short, and we have much to do.
           Though, we can still enjoy our time working together, yes?
           Return to my side, Dr. {nickname}.

Priestess: So it's you... AMa-10. It's been a long time for us too.
           Your current appearance is vastly different from the look you were born with,
           but I certainly recognize my very own creation that I poured my heart into.

Priestess: In the past four million plus natural day cycles, you seem to have exerted a lot of effort,
           but your behavioral standards appear to clash with the preset goal encoded at your birth.

Priestess: You seem a bit down, {nickname}. Care to share the reason with me?

Priestess: But we're prepared, yes?
           We've planted a seed of hope, and now we need only wait for it to grow a solution.
           Don't fret. Treat it as a regular hibernation. No different than prior time travels, just a little longer.
           And this time, I will be there by your side.
           I hope after crossing the quiet, endless night, the first thing I see when awake is you.

Priestess: I've never forgotten our matter of debate, {nickname}.
           We shouldn't hold any reservations towards each other.

Priestess: Then let's continue to wait.
           It's fine if you're not willing to hibernate yet. We still have some time.
           We can read the classics stored inside DWDB together,
           or interpret the many verses left by dead planets in this universe.
           Before you make up your mind, I'll never force you—
           I'll never impose my own will on yours.
           I'll wait, {nickname}, until you make the choice to stand by my side.

Priestess: Take it easy, {nickname}. Your recent observations must have exhausted you.

Priestess: Goodnight, {nickname}.
           Until the end of time, when we have transcended the silence of the universe.
           I will wait for you in that world.
```

### 2.5 15-8（第十五章，黑冠留存信息 / 前文明研究对话）

```
Priestess: (Unknown language) I don't believe I'll be able to create a language that will allow us
           to derive the ultimate answer. Not by myself, at least.
           (Unknown language) I stand on the shoulders of giants, after all.
           From the base I put together with the greatest discoveries of our colleagues' respective fields,
           I will continue onwards.

Priestess: (Unknown language) Of course. It wouldn't be the first time.
           (Unknown language) Does it look like we have anything better to do
           while we quietly wait for the darkness to swallow us?
           (Unknown language) Besides, I'm sure you won't say no to me, {nickname}.
```

